		"ClaimLevelFactTable, column 'Analyze Pathology'.",
		"Each column is a source header; where it is not already a COMMON alias, Aliases names the COMMON",
		"column it feeds - a lab-only alias group, so ClaimLevel.schema.json is unchanged for other labs.",
		"'Deposit Date' is declared on its own so it is the ONLY source of CheckDate: the COMMON CheckDate",
		"aliases also include 'Posted Date', which would otherwise fill CheckDate on denial-only postings.",
		"Consequence: 'Posted Date' is consumed by the CheckDate alias scan and does not reach the claim CSV.",
		"The same value is loaded at line level as PostingDate / PaymentPostedDate."
